    "detailed_description": "<strong>Tower Defense</strong><br>This is a Tower Defense game, in which you will fight against enemies with Towers, Bombs, Rollers and Drones.<br>You will start with only two Towers and simple Bombs, in each next Level you will get more weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406750/extras/dd7d77cc31c51908a2f006bdd306275a.poster.avif?t=1686863965\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406750/extras/dd7d77cc31c51908a2f006bdd306275a.webm?t=1686863965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406750/extras/dd7d77cc31c51908a2f006bdd306275a.mp4?t=1686863965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Big Bomb</strong><br>This big glowing ball that the enemies try to push forward is the Big Bomb, it is important that this Big Bomb never reaches your Defense Tower, otherwise... you know.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406750/extras/GIF_BigBomb.gif?t=1686863965\" /></span><br><br><br><strong>Gameplay </strong><br>Gameplay is simple, destroy Enemies and try to destroy Big Bomb as many times as possible, because this is your Mana Source.<br>Game has 14 levels in which the gameplay time is between 10 and 60 minutes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406750/extras/aae98a228945835b68a9744abdf1ccbc.poster.avif?t=1686863965\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406750/extras/aae98a228945835b68a9744abdf1ccbc.webm?t=1686863965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406750/extras/aae98a228945835b68a9744abdf1ccbc.mp4?t=1686863965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Demo</strong><br>There is a demo version of the game, please try it before you spend the money and buy the game.",
